references/photos.md and references/icons.md).

Nothing in this folder is part of the website. It is a design skill for the
coding assistant: instructions in SKILL.md, plus the scripts and page kits
those instructions use. Its scripts run a headless Chrome to check pages and
can download photographs, icons and Google Fonts.

To update it, replace this folder with the same folder from a newer commit of
the source, read what changed in its scripts, and change the commit above.
